full_description: QuantCo is an Applied AI company. We leverage expertise in engineering, AI research,
and economics to help organisations turn their data into critical strategic decisions
with significant economic impact.<br/><br/>

Founded by four PhDs from Harvard and Stanford, we're now over 250 technical experts
working with some of the largest financial, healthcare, automotive, and e-commerce
companies in Europe & the US.<br/><br/>

Our product lines include enterprise agents, cancer detection platforms, predictive
health suites, algorithmic pricing engines, data-driven claims management &
high-dimensional forecasting solutions.<br/><br/>

Our team operates from major hubs in the US and Europe, including Berlin, Munich,
Zurich, London, Boston, and San Francisco.

